  <name>Notav</name>
  <summary>Notes and a journal kept in your Nextcloud</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Notav keeps your notes as plain Markdown files in your Nextcloud, so the Nextcloud Notes
      app and Obsidian can open the same folder.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Works offline; changes sync when the server is reachable</li>
      <li>Notes edited on two devices at once are both kept</li>
      <li>Folders, search, and a Markdown editor</li>
      <li>Connects through GNOME Online Accounts or a browser sign-in</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
